#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lightdm.xml:243
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you installed Xorg in /opt, you will need to create a symbolic link so "
"lightdm can find the Xorg server.  As the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou o &quot;Xorg&quot; em &quot;/opt&quot;, [então] você "
"precisará criar um link simbólico, de forma que o &quot;lightdm&quot; possa "
"encontrar o servidor &quot;Xorg&quot;. Como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lightdm.xml:248
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ln -sf /opt/xorg/bin/Xorg /usr/bin/X</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ln -sf /opt/xorg/bin/Xorg /usr/bin/X</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lightdm.xml:255
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/lightdm.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed ... /usr/bin/lightdm-session</command>: This command ensures "
"that the initial login via the greeter sources /etc/profile and "
"~/.bash_profile.  Without this, commands that depend on different "
"environment variables may not work as expected."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed ... /usr/bin/lightdm-session</command>: Esse comando garante o "
"&quot;login&quot; inicial por intermédio dos fontes do saudador "
"&quot;/etc/profile&quot; e &quot;~/.bash_profile&quot;. Sem isso, comandos "
"que dependem de diferentes variáveis de ambiente possivelmente não funcionem"
" conforme o esperado."

